A glossy green icon in the [[frutiger-aero|Frutiger Aero]] style, with a soft gradient fill and a thick rounded outline. OpenDB uses it on the `{{cleanup}}`, `{{copy edit}}` and `{{too technical}}` templates, for entries whose writing could be improved. A smaller copy is used on the site itself.
